אבא</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">דופן</span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">מה זה מָלַק?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">אח של בלק</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">התמנה למלך</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">עמלק</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">חתך</span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">מה זה שְׂאֹר?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">שער שמאלי</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">בצק חמוץ</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">שיער הקרבן</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">החלק המיותר מהעור</span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">מה זה&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">עָשַׁק</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">?</span></span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">הֵכִין שַׂק</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">הִשְׁתּוֹקֵק</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">גָּזָל</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">אָכַל קַשׁ</span></span></li></ol></ol></h3><p></p><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מדרגאות</span></h2><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 שאינו חי<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 כתב את שמו לצורך אישור<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 קבע את המחיר<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 סוג של מחבת (מהפרשה)\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 משכים\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 בעוד יומיים מאתמול\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 שאינו מתוק</span></span></p></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></h2><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ביטוי מקראי</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">1: \"</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְעָרַךְ הַכֹּהֵן אֹתָם <span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">עַל הָעֵצִים</span> אֲשֶׁר עַל הָאֵשׁ\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">2:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"עֹלָה הוּא אִשֵּׁה <span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">רֵיחַ נִיחֹחַ</span>\"</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">3: \"</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּמָלַק <span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">אֶת רֹאשׁוֹ</span> וְהִקְטִיר הַמִּזְבֵּחָה\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">4:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">\"וְעָרְכוּ עֵצִים <span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">עַל הָאֵשׁ</span>\"</span></p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מבחן אמריקאי</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">1- חלב<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">2- חתך<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">3- בצק חמוץ<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">4- גזל</span></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מדרגאות</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מת, חתם, תמחר, מרחשת, משחר, מחר, מר</span></p></span></div></div></div><br />"
